      "text": "MARKS ON A PIECE (UK example — most comprehensive)\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Sponsor's  │  Standard  │  Assay Office  │  Date       │\n│  Mark       │  Mark      │  Mark          │  Letter     │\n│  (maker)    │  (purity)  │  (which office)│  (year)     │\n│  ABC▲       │  ♦750♦     │  anchor (Birm.)│  'f' (2024) │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
